<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak markets closed Thursday for state holiday.</title>
<headline>Slovak markets closed Thursday for state holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bratislava Stock Exchange and the Slovak foreign exchange and money markets are closed on Thursday for a state holiday commemorating the Slovak National Uprising.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
</text>
